{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":70802,\"title\":\"Prophet Joseph\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"This story basically follows the most important happenings in Prophet Josephs life, from the view of muslims. The most important happenings are: 1. his travel to egypt 2. his rise and growing up in Egypt 3. his life problems when his \\\"owner\\\" Zuleikha falls in love with him and wants him to return the love to him. 4. his stay in prison, and how he reforms the prisoners. 5. his return by the side of the Pharao. 6. his uprising to the side of the pharao as his advisor. 7. his brothers coming to egypt, and how he decides to make them regret their mistakes so they can receive forgivness, and peace. 8. his reunion with his family after more than 20 years.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/h7nsyR0I53gM6P1Inxl438UnqS7.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u4yhC4Q8bS1w7FWIPpKsmY4nv9E.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":7.6,\"voteCount\":34,\"year\":2009,\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"status\":\"Ended\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":1,\"totalEpisodes\":45,\"createdBy\":[\"Farajollah Salahshoor\",\"Jamal Shoorje\"],\"networks\":[\"IRIB TV1\",\"Kanal 7\",\"PTV Home\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"IR\",\"name\":\"Iran\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2009-10-30\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1936908,\"name\":\"Farajollah Salahshoor\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hIicH5YyxPgIg4OPrqdbOmVyeKh.jpg\"},{\"id\":1375317,\"name\":\"Mostafa Zamani\",\"character\":\"Prophet Joseph\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2eKwkwLGXoqZ3akoe1PbofewqQe.jpg\"},{\"id\":2049325,\"name\":\"Katayoun Riahi\",\"character\":\"Zuleikha\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7PUo2t0HekvSB1TE3pV7McNWV1p.jpg\"},{\"id\":2049323,\"name\":\"Mahmoud Pakniat\",\"character\":\"Prophet Jacob\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rK6fa7MYfnEqql0oLartjGe966I.jpg\"},{\"id\":2305422,\"name\":\"Amir Hossein Modarres\",\"character\":\"Inaroos\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2156883,\"name\":\"Rahim Norouzi\",\"character\":\"Akhenaten\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uR8NvXyTbPuEzrGzIuYYMAPDuxL.jpg\"},{\"id\":2305424,\"name\":\"Jahanbakhsh Soltani\",\"character\":\"Amenhotep III\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/f93BNIiuO6icqm7CClP1ni9IKAU.jpg\"},{\"id\":1098595,\"name\":\"Parvaneh Massoumi\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mJ3Sj3lMHJPUuGVlxiaSljiqW5.jpg\"},{\"id\":1719214,\"name\":\"Jafar Dehghan\",\"character\":\"Potiphar\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/a5u7QgNpsdfy4QzUITfaypim9ky.jpg\"},{\"id\":1936908,\"name\":\"Farajollah Salahshoor\",\"character\":\"Azrael\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hIicH5YyxPgIg4OPrqdbOmVyeKh.jpg\"},{\"id\":1555247,\"name\":\"Seyed Reza Razavi\",\"character\":\"Horemheb\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1592138,\"name\":\"Abbas Amiri\",\"character\":\"Ankh Mahoo\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1374277,\"name\":\"Ala Mohseni\",\"character\":\"Ninifer Kibta\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1717658,\"name\":\"Ardalan Shojakave\",\"character\":\"Gabriel\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/p9D4zkNSUPPKiqSCWvao4SCFxLe.jpg\"},{\"id\":1470016,\"name\":\"Elham Hamidi\",\"character\":\"Asenath\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/n9e2oJnGHR3J7edVH8jICYU0mso.jpg\"},{\"id\":2515253,\"name\":\"Leila Bolukat\",\"character\":\"Akhenaten's Wife\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vEjCy0x2Tk4VQRwr5dOn6DCXpk2.jpg\"}],\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"G1JOnI36Z6c\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"FZdnvJa_T1w\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"_oV6NGyC4Es\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":2701,\"title\":\"Napoleon\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7Mw5fkDwm1Pg4JLeUgP3SgoOsTJ.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.43417721518987346,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":246459,\"title\":\"Kafka\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hdd9wpmgOWuvm9oqSBNMxth2xfU.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.43200000000000005,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":247441,\"title\":\"Testament: The Story of Moses\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rRMIvf9OismdaKSuyUoo3mQa3iD.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.43043478260869567,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":244131,\"title\":\"The True Story of Alexander the Great\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/klsJxE8Vn53noj5XsnUKL4e8WWm.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4272727272727273,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":131141,\"title\":\"American Sports Story: Aaron Hernandez\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5gn5D2RX4aOSE4iAwjdSSudlNR0.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.42400000000000004,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":31556,\"title\":\"Seize the Day\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qMgASlyaHMTU4oGkIJWJfv4goSf.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.42258064516129035,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":60705,\"title\":\"Faking It\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vb9J7q977HB3AmvLETpmWIyIyTP.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.42258064516129035,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":63943,\"title\":\"Anna German\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cz8mG4M5e2omGqgvl57oHOqDDlo.jpg\",\"rating\":4.3,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.42255639097744363,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":283895,\"title\":\"Mere Sai Shraddha Aur Saburi\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dfuvBZfVV1Tk5jKlld2W66rOx3r.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.41750000000000004,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":97180,\"title\":\"Selena: The Series\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yQ9liJVd07zSOFECJ0actCzaXZd.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.41621621621621624,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":213550,\"title\":\"The Final Score\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mAYM4n8NJXLC5no3PkkjPb1ZYBb.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4155844155844156,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":284196,\"title\":\"Vanguard\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/e5XkuYPdvnb9a1LJqc6uuFnY1Eh.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4142857142857143,\"_genreOverlap\":1}],\"seasonNumber\":1,\"seasonName\":\"Season 1\",\"seasonOverview\":\"\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4nq9fGuV3mJ35n9BJLOmqQvoUlF.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2009-08-22\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Episode 1\",\"overview\":\"The noble Prophet Jacob preaches the message of monotheism to a polytheistic nation whilst a drought further accelerates the tension between Jacob and his people. A sorceress loyally serves a deity known as Ishtar and directly opposes Jacobs message along with most of the citizens of Fadan.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2009-08-22\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Episode 2\",\"overview\":\"Rachel bears the pain of pregnancy as Jacob and his entourage closely support her. An incident occures in Ca'naan that will change things forever. Loyalties begin to shift and Jacob recieves some bad news about his father Isaac.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2009-08-23\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Episode 3\",\"overview\":\"The family are still reeling from recent events with the macabre reality of death overshadowing the blessing of birth. People of Ka'naan pledge allegiance to Jacob before he heads to Abrahams tomb to resurrect his vow. Joseph's brothers begin to grow more jealous of their younger sibling as Rachel's sisters compete to adopt him as their own. An innocent game of hide and seek goes awry.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2009-08-24\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Episode 4\",\"overview\":\"Faeghe schemes to gain further custody of Joseph. Some time afterward Joseph has a dream which proves to have ambiguous connotations. Jacob offers a date branch to the rest of his older children in an effort to quell their envious attitudes.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2009-08-25\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Episode 5\",\"overview\":\"Jacob awakens from a startling nightmare which he hesitantly attributes to his sons. Conversely Joseph has a pleasant but enigmatic dream involving his brothers which causes his father to advise him to keep it to himself. The brothers receive a mysterious visitor who claims to have knowledge about them. A conspiracy unravels that may decide Joseph's fate.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2009-08-26\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Episode 6\",\"overview\":\"Jacob finally allows Joseph to accompany their brothers to the plains. But will they uphold their promise to their father.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2009-08-27\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Episode 7\",\"overview\":\"Led by Judah the fraternity return to their father with the feigned testimony regarding Josephs disappearance. Despite his lack of forethought Levi sympathizes with his younger brother and tentatively attempts to do whats right. Meanwhile Joseph encounters glimmers of hope in his isolation.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-08-28\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Episode 8\",\"overview\":\"A trading caravan happen upon the well where Joseph is located and a power play immediately ensues between the merchants and the brothers for proprietorship of Joseph. The intense rivalry between Levi and Judah reaches boiling point as they come to blows following their decided agreement. Benjamin offers little solace to a grieving Jacob.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-08-29\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Episode 9\",\"overview\":\"Members of the caravan witness sequential signs of Joseph and are taken aback by his cultivating beauty and innocence. Thereafter the company reach the gates of an old and storied nation all the while passing by the famed River Nile. Back in Ka'naan Jacob and Lia begin to lose any hope of ever seeing Joseph again.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-08-30\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Episode 10\",\"overview\":\"A competitive auction bidding takes place to win the services of Joseph. The Kings advisor Potiphar makes his presence known to the citizens of Egypt and lays claim to the young bondsman. Malek attempts to get to the bottom of Joseph's origin.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-08-31\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Episode 11\",\"overview\":\"Queen Zuleikha entrusts her treasured gift to the palace chamberlain, Honifer. Soon he is given an extended excursion in and around his new residence. Thereafter, \\\"Uzarsif\\\" demonstrates his skill as a prodigy and continues to impress the community at large. Karimama grows suspicious of this and warns Zuleikha against becoming too affectionate to a low-born.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-09-01\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Episode 12\",\"overview\":\"More political and religious intrigue finds it's way to the royal court as Joseph is promoted within the household. Jacob undertakes a new initiative in Ka'naan.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-09-02\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":13,\"name\":\"Episode 13\",\"overview\":\"Zuleikha educates Joseph regarding the rituals and customs of Egypt. Another idol by the name of Amun, revered by the populace receives measured criticism from Joseph. The grand Pharaoh Amenhotep entertains a visit from Potiphar and his young companion and witnesses Joseph's fabled percipience first-hand. General Rodamon agrees to train Joseph at the behest of Potiphar.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-09-03\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":14,\"name\":\"Episode 14\",\"overview\":\"Joseph continues his training with Rodomon and his rapid improvement leaves a lasting mark on the Egyptian nobles. An ailing Honifer is nursed by his colleagues. The conflict between the crown and the temple threatens to erupt. Zuleikha grows irritated at Karimama's encroaching mannerisms.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-09-04\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":15,\"name\":\"Episode 15\",\"overview\":\"Joseph officially supersedes the late Honifer as the Palace Chamberlain. Zuleikha's tries to take her mind off him by departing on a short voyage. After a conversation with Nemisabu, Joseph senses that he may be in danger. Benjamin comforts his father to little avail.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-09-05\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":16,\"name\":\"Episode 16\",\"overview\":\"Lady Zuleikha and Joseph's odd behaviour arouses Potiphars suspicions. Her obsession with Joseph spirals out of control. We witness one of the most pivotal and famous moments of Joseph's entire life...\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-09-06\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":17,\"name\":\"Episode 17\",\"overview\":\"The ramifications of recent events are felt throughout Egypt with the Temple monks vying for an opportunity to ruin the nobility. Zuleikha resolves to evince the true nature of Joseph by throwing a party.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-09-07\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":18,\"name\":\"Episode 18\",\"overview\":\"The Sovereign Bishop hires one of Amuns most loyal worshippers for a deadly assignment. Potiphar desperately tries to quell the scandalous climate in the capital whilst protecting the vulnerable Pharaoh. Zuleikha finally delivers on her promise to Joseph.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-09-08\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":19,\"name\":\"Episode 19\",\"overview\":\"After being fettered and chained, Joseph crosses the threshold of the Prison and stumbles upon a familiar face. The inmates are quickly drawn to Joseph as he endeavours to aid their rehabilitation. Kidamen, the prison warden delivers a message to Joseph from Lady Zuleikha but he remains unperturbed. The temple monks pursue the Imonhotep conspirators.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-09-09\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":20,\"name\":\"Episode 20\",\"overview\":\"Kimonyee tries to infiltrate Zavira Prison in order to get close to an associate. Potiphar brutually interrogates Apopis and Iranus in order to get to the bottom of the truth regarding the attempt on Imonhoteps life. With Joseph's popularity soaring within prison walls, Lady Zuleikha and Ninifer Keptah separately take measures to make his life in prison unbearable.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-09-10\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":21,\"name\":\"Episode 21\",\"overview\":\"Fate brings a travelling Canaanite to the outskirts of Egypt where he meets unbeknownst to him Joseph, son of Jacob. Ninifer Keptah remains skeptical about Joseph's indoctrinating lessons. Iranus and Apopis approach Joseph and seek his adroitness after having strange dreams. This results in the exact juncture of time where Joseph demonstrates his unique skill for the first time.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-09-11\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":22,\"name\":\"Episode 22\",\"overview\":\"Lady Zuleikha obstinately sends Karimama to parley with Joseph. The monks are summoned ro King Imonhotep's Palace and an epic confrontation takes place. Who will prevail? A penitent Joseph realizes he made a mistake.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-09-12\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":23,\"name\":\"Episode 23\",\"overview\":\"Almost 3 days after the dream interpretations, the inevitable reality soon comes to pass. It is implied God allows the heir of Imonhotep to become indisposed as a means to rectify Joseph's past error. Meanwhile the King himself feels the debilitating effects of overindulgence. The prisoners faith in Joseph is continuously strengthened. Lady Zuleikha struggles with the unending absence of her beloved.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-09-13\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":24,\"name\":\"Episode 24\",\"overview\":\"An official coronation to crown the new Pharaoh takes place. Soon after he has an eerie dream which causes him to seek out Padyamoon and the dream interpreters in an effort to decipher its meaning. Inarus knows of a solution, but has misgivings about speaking out to the King.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-06-05\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":25,\"name\":\"Episode 25\",\"overview\":\"Pharaoh Imonhotep IV commands the \\\"Ebrani slave\\\" be brought to him for an assembly but is denied until he probes a past scandal in the hopes of officially clearing his name. Potiphar is anxious he will be disgraced after the King discovers how he originally dealt with the situation. Anekmaho and his retinue of monks are fraught with anxiety at the prospect of being thwarted by Joseph. The truth is finally broadcast as a new era in Egypt emerges.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-06-12\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":26,\"name\":\"Episode 26\",\"overview\":\"The mystical dream interpreters are pitted against Joseph in a bid to finally put the matter to bed and give some closure to the Kings seemingly ambiguous dream. Joseph shoulders a new burden and thus, has even more responsibility than ever before. Bounties are dished out to the esteemed Ca'annite as the Kings awe of him is enhanced. An enraged Potiphar harshly admonishes Zuleikha after a decade of awkward avoidance of each other.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-06-19\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":27,\"name\":\"Episode 27\",\"overview\":\"The ultimate test of a lifetime begins in Egypt as the unified citizens rally behind Joseph. Anekmaho is irate by his sudden upturn in governmental power and so launches a counter-offensive toward the aristocrats by striving to turn the people against him. Iranus is deployed as a spy on Josephs instruction so they can anticipate the monks next move. Malek tirelessly awaits for an emotional reunion with Joseph after 20 years.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-06-26\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":28,\"name\":\"Episode 28\",\"overview\":\"Joseph takes the first initiative to preserve Egypts interests by readjusting the economic and agricultural system in the country. A prominent figure in Joseph's life is adjacent to death but will he get the ending he wants? The Queen mother nominates Anekmaho's puppet Horenhop as his successor. The alliance between the Pharaoh and Joseph grows stronger by each passing day.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-07-03\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":29,\"name\":\"Episode 29\",\"overview\":\"The Temple monks resort to perilous strategies to strip Joseph of his power and consolidate the dominion of Amun. The Pharaoh is invited to accept monotheism. A bureaucratic declaration shocks the populace besides the ones who originally acquired faith. Joseph resolves to bridge the gap between the wealthy and poor in each district. The mercenary hired by Horenhop observes warily, waiting for the perfect opportunity to pounce on his target.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-07-10\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":30,\"name\":\"Episode 30\",\"overview\":\"A substitute for the late Ninifer Keptah wastes little time in going after Joseph. However Joseph remains steadfast and puts trust in the one true God whilst renovating parts of the capital in preparation for the looming famine. Jacob attends a funeral and supplicates for his kin. The monks try to hinder Josephs efforts in filling the wheat depositories. Zuleikha hits rock bottom in her perennial desolation.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-07-17\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":31,\"name\":\"Episode 31\",\"overview\":\"5 years have passed since Joseph first made the prediction and consequently the nobility assume further confidence in him. Zuleikha makes the odd request to have the guards leave their post save for General Rodomon. With the palace vulnerable, certain individuals capitalize on this opportunity to plunder. The monks are caught red-handed doing something rather vindictive.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-07-24\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":32,\"name\":\"Episode 32\",\"overview\":\"Joseph returns to Thebes amidst a welcoming crowd and immediately visits the King. He and his wife afterwards present Joseph with a confounding gift. An untimely death shakes Zuleikha to her very core, but will she have the strength to continue living her life without them? The next stage of Joseph's ominous forecast commences.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-07-31\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":33,\"name\":\"Episode 33\",\"overview\":\"Signs for the onset of the famine appear throughout Egypt, whilst Joseph resumes serving the people. Senior citizens of Ka'naan and Egypt respectively experience the true extent of old age and their feeble lifestyle. Kimui and the other monks spurn the opportunity to buy wheat for the temple. The servants of Zuleikha sorrowfully embark on another chapter of their lives.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-08-07\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":34,\"name\":\"Episode 34\",\"overview\":\"Neighbouring countries of Egypt arrive to buy wheat as they are too famine-stricken. Malek intends to announce the names of these nations to the public. After being provoked by the Temple Priests, Lady Tee angrily confronts the royal authorities. As a result the king places her under surveillance. The Temple also contemplate utilizing the treasury; the apparent source of Amuns power to exchange for wheat. The economic providence in Thebes prospers.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-08-14\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":35,\"name\":\"Episode 35\",\"overview\":\"Horenhop and Rodamon return to Egypt with tales of war. Joseph, now happily married with children advocates monotheism as the official faith of the country. The waves of Joseph's supporters overwhelm Amuns worshippers and thus threatens to escalate into something much worse.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-08-21\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":36,\"name\":\"Episode 36\",\"overview\":\"The Temple monks amusingly organize an open buffet for the remaining servants of Amun in order to rally them for retribution following the previous attack on one of Joseph's silos. Shortly thereafter, Horenhop arrives under the command of the King with his cavalry with the driven purpose of besiegeing and defeating the Temple once and for all. Jacob counsels the people of Ka'naan to tackle the struggles of famine by relocating to another country.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-08-28\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":37,\"name\":\"Episode 37\",\"overview\":\"The children of Jacob set out from Ka'naan with their fathers blessing whilst Joseph still yearns for a reunion with his family. Destiny brings them closer together, but will they eventually cross paths.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-09-04\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":38,\"name\":\"Episode 38\",\"overview\":\"Joseph entertains his guests and notices a brother absent from the company. Zuleikha praises the God of Joseph and considers submitting to his will. Rodamon returns to Thebes and catches up with the affairs of the capital and runs into a familiar face.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-09-11\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":39,\"name\":\"Episode 39\",\"overview\":\"The monotheists have made the temple a place of worship for the people of the one god. Zuleika is noticed after calling out Josephs name Josephs wife is frustrated with Joseph after finding out he has ignored Zuleika for all these years.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-09-18\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":40,\"name\":\"Episode 40\",\"overview\":\"Zuleikha refuses to see Joseph citing her devotional solitude and service to God as her reasons. The Israelites return to Ka'naan and are puzzled when they find the money used to purchase the wheat back in their possession. Jacob makes his children take a solemn vow to protect and return Benjamin safely when they travel back to Egypt for more sustenance.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-09-25\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":41,\"name\":\"Episode 41\",\"overview\":\"The sons of Jacob cautiously approach the gates of Egypt heeding their fathers advice to split up and enter different checkpoints simultaneously. Once inside, they are escorted to the Pharaoh's Palace where they are received by Joseph. But will he reveal his identity to the brothers.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-10-02\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":42,\"name\":\"Episode 42\",\"overview\":\"Joseph uses a past experience to inspire a ploy to claim Benjamin as his own. The brothers however, refuse to leave Egypt without their youngest sibling. Asenad and Zuleikha discuss their love for Joseph. Jacobs sorrow reaches an all-time high after he hears 2 more of his sons have been separated from him.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-10-09\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":43,\"name\":\"Episode 43\",\"overview\":\"With renewed purpose and conviction Jacob sends his sons back to Egypt to confront Egypt's dear advisor and retrieve information about Joseph and Benjamin. The Pharaoh pressures Zuleikha into marrying Joseph but is hesitant. The monotheistic slaves of Egypt are wholly liberated by Joseph.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-10-16\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":44,\"name\":\"Episode 44\",\"overview\":\"The children of Israel are reunited with Joseph after many decades and are overwhelmed by the the treatment of their long lost brother. Levi returns to Ka'naan with a task from Joseph. Jacob implores his sons to make amends following the exposure of their crimes.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-10-23\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":45,\"name\":\"Episode 45\",\"overview\":\"The epic story of Joseph comes to an emotional end as Jacob is finally reunited with his most beloved after more than 30 years. With 2 generations of prophets meeting in Egypt, the long drought is officially over. The dream envisioned by Joseph in his youth comes full circle.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-10-30\",\"runtime\":45}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2009-08-22\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}